<title>UK: TC Group shares fall after profit warning.</title>
<headline>TC Group shares fall after profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in TC Group Plc fell on Wednesday after the company said its results for the year ended December 31 1996 would be modestly below market expectations.</p>
<p>By 1535 GMT the shares were down 25p at 114-1/2p, with trading volume reaching 2.4 million shares.</p>
<p>The nursing home operator said its results had been hit by lower occupancy rates in recently-opened and recently-acquired care homes in the final quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7945</p>
